Checked in WE02. All outbound DESADV IDocs for Brightwater since 7 Oct are in=
 status 51, so nothing was sent to their EDI gateway. The error text points t=
o the pallet SSCC segment. Message type is DESADV, partner BRIGHTW. So far 15=
 IDocs are stuck, 6 from yesterday and 9 from today. Screenshot and the 7 Oct=
 IDocs are below. Pieter, can you look at the mapping? I cannot see the cause=
 in the delivery data, the SSCCs on the handling units look normal in VL03N.

